Find out the eigen value of the matrix $$A = \left[ {\matrix{
   1 &amp; 0 &amp; 0  \cr 
   2 &amp; 3 &amp; 1  \cr 
   0 &amp; 2 &amp; 4  \cr 

 } } \right]$$ for any one of the eigen  values, find out the corresponding eigen vector?

en.answer:
$$\lambda  = 1,2,5$$ are the eigen values $$K\left[ {\matrix{
   1  \cr 
   { - 3/2}  \cr 
   1  \cr 

 } } \right]$$ is an eigen vector of matrix $$A$$ corresponding to $$\lambda  = 1$$ for $$K \ne 0$$
